{"parse":{"title":"The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials","pageid":395721,"revid":1901780,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b3/Constellation_The_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024429\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b3/Constellation_The_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024429\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b3/Constellation_The_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024429 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b3/Constellation_The_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024429 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_The_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Theory_of_Ash%E2%80%94Field_Equilibrium\" title=\"The Theory of Ash—Field Equilibrium\">The Theory of Ash—Field Equilibrium</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cake_and_the_Art_of_Mechanism_Repair\" title=\"Cake and the Art of Mechanism Repair\">Cake and the Art of Mechanism Repair</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">If Aino is off-field while the Focused Hydronic Cooling Zone of her Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Precision_Hydronic_Cooler\" title=\"Precision Hydronic Cooler\">Precision Hydronic Cooler</a> is active, when your active <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> member hits a nearby opponent with an attack, the Cool Your Jets Ducky will fire an additional water ball at that opponent, dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>AoE Hydro DMG</b></span> equal to 25% of Aino's <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a> and 100% of her <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a>. This DMG is considered Elemental Burst DMG. This effect can be triggered once every 5s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Principle of Transference in Gear Differentials</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable thc tdl\" style=\"min-width:600px\">\n<tbody><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Gauge_Theory\" title=\"Elemental Gauge Theory\">Gauge<br />Units</a></th><th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Internal_Cooldown\" title=\"Internal Cooldown\">Internal Cooldown</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance\" title=\"Interruption Resistance\">Poise<br />Damage</a></th><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance/Stagger\" title=\"Interruption Resistance/Stagger\">Stagger Effect</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blunt_Attack\" title=\"Blunt Attack\">Blunt</a></th></tr><tr><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Tag\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Tag</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Type\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Type</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"S. L.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">S. L.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Stagger Level</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"H. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">H. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Horizontal Force</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"V. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">V. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Vertical Force</span></span>&#8205;</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">Water Ball</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">1U</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left\">No ICD</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">25</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Light</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">200</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><span class=\"check-no\" data-sort-value=\"3\" title=\"No\">&#10008;</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Principle_of_Transference_in_Gear_Differentials%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-sectio